+// mt32-pi diagnostics profiling (not part of upstream Nuked-SC55).
+//
+// Coarse phase accounting for the optimization work: wall time inside
+// Emulator::Step split into PCM rendering vs everything else (H8
+// instruction execution, timers, UART, analog), plus the executed
+// instruction count. A host installs a microsecond clock to enable it;
+// with no clock installed (the default) every seam costs one predictable
+// branch and accumulates nothing.
