+
+// NEON_MIX_TAIL_V2 is defined ONLY for this function (scoped
+// #define/#undef): the round-2 diff guards its asm block with a
+// defined() test on this macro, and without the define the
+// function would compile to the scalar branch -- i.e. baseline
+// twice. Baseline/sched/pipe contain no such #if, so they are
+// unaffected either way.
+#define NEON_MIX_TAIL_V2
